                    </div>
                    <div class="list-group-item">
                        <strong class="text-primary">Luo:</strong> 
                        <span class="ms-2">"Ber, orwaki e chik mar puonj dwol."</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="list-group-item">
                        <strong class="text-primary">German:</strong> 
                        <span class="ms-2">"Hallo, willkommen beim Klangtraining-Spiel."</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="list-group-item">
                        <strong class="text-primary">Korean:</strong> 
                        <span class="ms-2">"안녕하세요, 사운드 트레이닝 게임에 오신 것을 환영합니다."</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="list-group-item">
                        <strong class="text-primary">Hindi:</strong> 
                        <span class="ms-2">"नमस्ते, ध्वनि प्रशिक्षण खेल में आपका स्वागत है।"</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="list-group-item">
                        <strong class="text-primary">Bengali:</strong> 
                        <span class="ms-2">"হ্যালো, সাউন্ড ট্রেনিং গেমে স্বাগতম।"</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="list-group-item">
                        <strong class="text-primary">Telugu:</strong> 
                        <span class="ms-2">"హలో, సౌండ్ ట్రైనింగ్ గేమ్‌కి స్వాగతం."</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="list-group-item">
                        <strong class="text-primary">Farsi:</strong> 
                        <span class="ms-2">"سلام، به بازی آموزش صدا خوش آمدید."</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="list-group-item">
                        <strong class="text-primary">Kurdish:</strong> 
                        <span class="ms-2">"سڵاو، بەخێربێن بۆ یارییەکی ڕاهێنانی دەنگ."</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
        </main>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <footer class="bg-dark text-white text-center py-4 mt-5">
            <div class="container">
                <p class="mb-0">
                    <i class="bi bi-gear-fill me-2"></i>Powered by Google TTS (gTTS) + pyttsx3 | Express + EJS
                </p>
            </div>
        </footer>
    </div>

    <!-- Close to Heart Language Selection Modal -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="closeToHeartModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="closeToHeartModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
            <div class="modal-content">
                <div class="modal-header" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);">
                    <h5 class="modal-title text-white" id="closeToHeartModalLabel">
                        <i class="bi bi-heart-fill me-2"></i>Close to Heart - Select Languages
                    </h5>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body">
                    <p class="text-muted mb-4">Choose your languages to view sacred texts and wisdom in dual-language format.</p>
                    <form id="closeToHeartForm">
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label for="cthNativeLanguage" class="form-label fw-bold">
                                <i class="bi bi-person-fill me-2"></i>Your Native Language
                            </label>
                            <select id="cthNativeLanguage" class="form-select form-select-lg" required>
                                <% languages.forEach(lang => { %>
                                    <option value="<%= lang %>" <%= lang === 'english' ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= languageNames[lang] %></option>
                                <% }); %>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label for="cthTargetLanguage" class="form-label fw-bold">
                                <i class="bi bi-person-badge-fill me-2"></i>Target Language to Learn
                            </label>
                            <select id="cthTargetLanguage" class="form-select form-select-lg" required>
                                <% languages.forEach(lang => { %>
                                    <option value="<%= lang %>" <%= lang === 'amharic' ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= languageNames[lang] %></option>
                                <% }); %>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Cancel</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn text-white" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);" onclick="goToCloseToHeart()">
                        <i class="bi bi-heart-fill me-2"></i>Continue
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        function goToCloseToHeart() {
            const native = document.getElementById('cthNativeLanguage').value;
            const target = document.getElementById('cthTargetLanguage').value;
            window.location.href = `/close-to-heart?native=${native}&target=${target}`;
        }
    </script>

    <!-- Bootstrap JS -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <!-- Custom JS -->
    <script src="/js/main.js?v=<%= Date.now() %>"></script>
    <script src="/js/select2-init.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
